    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The 2D Fighting Game With a Twist: It's Turn-Based! </strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.poster.avif?t=1753644137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.webm?t=1753644137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Mega Knockdown is a fast-paced combo of turn-based strategy and classic 2D fighters. Get ready to jump right into the real challenge at the heart of fighting games: outsmarting your friends and predicting their next move!<br><br><strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple controls with no timing requirement<br></li><li>Deep strategy and challenging single player CPU opponents<br></li><li>Smooth online play, anywhere across the globe! <br></li><li>Play a fighting game at your own pace: take your turns slowly and strategically, or raise your heartbeat with BLITZ time settings!<br></li><li>Meet colorful hand-drawn characters: the fireball-throwing slacker, the grappler with a heart of gold, the burnout haunted by a long-limbed spirit, and more!<br></li><li>Jockey for position and weave in and out of range of attacks. Are you a true master of fighting game footsies? Prove it!<br></li><li>Get the upper hand on your opponents with a knockdown, and press the advantage with a 'meaty attack' on their wakeup!<br></li><li>Express yourself! Do you carefully block and punish your way to victory, or do you assert dominance with a wild and aggressive gameplan?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modes and Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade Mode (with story scenes)<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer Lobbies<br></li><li>Local Versus<br></li><li>Interactive Tutorial<br></li><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Blitz speed variants<br></li><li>Training Mode with frame data display<br></li><li>Replays Viewer<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Accessible difficulty settings<br></li><li>6 Playable Characters<br></li><li>3 Selectable Art Styles<br></li><li>Swappable, moddable character color palettes</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The 2D Fighting Game With a Twist: It's Turn-Based! </strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.poster.avif?t=1753644137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.webm?t=1753644137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Mega Knockdown is a fast-paced combo of turn-based strategy and classic 2D fighters. Get ready to jump right into the real challenge at the heart of fighting games: outsmarting your friends and predicting their next move!<br><br><strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple controls with no timing requirement<br></li><li>Deep strategy and challenging single player CPU opponents<br></li><li>Smooth online play, anywhere across the globe! <br></li><li>Play a fighting game at your own pace: take your turns slowly and strategically, or raise your heartbeat with BLITZ time settings!<br></li><li>Meet colorful hand-drawn characters: the fireball-throwing slacker, the grappler with a heart of gold, the burnout haunted by a long-limbed spirit, and more!<br></li><li>Jockey for position and weave in and out of range of attacks. Are you a true master of fighting game footsies? Prove it!<br></li><li>Get the upper hand on your opponents with a knockdown, and press the advantage with a 'meaty attack' on their wakeup!<br></li><li>Express yourself! Do you carefully block and punish your way to victory, or do you assert dominance with a wild and aggressive gameplan?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modes and Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade Mode (with story scenes)<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer Lobbies<br></li><li>Local Versus<br></li><li>Interactive Tutorial<br></li><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Blitz speed variants<br></li><li>Training Mode with frame data display<br></li><li>Replays Viewer<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Accessible difficulty settings<br></li><li>6 Playable Characters<br></li><li>3 Selectable Art Styles<br></li><li>Swappable, moddable character color palettes</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fighting game where the action only moves when you do. Plan your next move, then strike, evade and punish! Knock 'em down and press the advantage! Fight colorful hand-drawn characters, and challenge your friends to an epic battle of wits!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe ultimate 'read your opponent' simulator!\u201d<br>Super Combo<br><br>\u201cThe building blocks of Mega Knockdown are honestly quite impressive. It\u2019s something that absolutely sounds insane and probably shouldn\u2019t work, yet it does.\u201d<br>Special Cancel<br>",
